  {
    "id": "TC15",
    "title": "现有内容研究门槛",
    "statement": "建筑researchPrerequisites为全满足。切石Stonecutting；手裁缝ComplexClothing；电裁缝再Electricity；燃锻Smithing；电锻再Electricity；电池Batteries；太阳能SolarPanels；木发电机/电线/Heater Electricity；Cooler AirConditioning；燃料炉无研究。树由TreeBase继承TreeSowing和Plants6；LongSword配方LongBlades+Crafting5。BasicShirt/Pants/Duster/Tuque配方另需ComplexClothing；Parka所选父链无独立recipe研究门槛，工作台门槛独立。",
